# Docker compose files prontos para copiar

## Postgres + Redis
docker compose -f docker/postgres-redis.yml up -d

## MailHog (email em dev)
docker compose -f docker/mailhog.yml up -d

## LocalStack (AWS local)
docker compose -f docker/localstack.yml up -d

## Todas as stacks de uma vez
docker compose -f docker/postgres-redis.yml -f docker/mailhog.yml up -d
